cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The World on Record: statistical reporting across countries, policy sectors, and time"
message: "If you use these scores or this code, please cite the work below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Sanchez
    given-names: Sevastian
    affiliation: "Columbia University"
    email: ss7257@columbia.edu
abstract: >-
  The first transparency measure covering the SDG era: latent reporting
  behaviour across 607 statistical series and 197 countries, 2015-2023, with
  uncertainty quantified for every country-year. The dataset provides the
  World on Record Index (TWR), an overall score per country-year estimated by
  item response theory on the UN Global SDG Indicators Database, together with
  sector-level scores and the per-series item parameters.
keywords:
  - transparency
  - missing data
  - Sustainable Development Goals
  - item response theory
  - official statistics
  - data availability
  - democratic backsliding
